+ * members are options of the vocabulary, as a dialogue line's are, but max_seconds, which max_frames sets, a member set
+ * to null counting as left out; and `max_frames`, a whole number from 1 to INT_MAX. Any other member is refused, a seed
+ * beside the speakers among them. Returns false with the input at fault, a member or a speaker's option, and why.
+ */
+bool read_battle(const JsonValue & message, Battle & out, std::string & option, std::string & problem);
+
+/**
+ * The failure of speaker `index`'s conversation as the battle reports it: the library's code, the speaker named at the
+ * start of the message, and the option max_seconds, which the battle sets from max_frames, named max_frames.
